        "blurb": "Target rule: [`.cursor/rules/builder-operator-habits.mdc`](../../../../../.cursor/rules/builder-operator-habits.mdc) Method SSOT: [`.cursor/rules/zeya888-operator-method.mdc`](../../../../../.cursor/rules/zeya888-oper…",
